The server runs as a systemd service on an arm64 cgroup v2 host
(CPUQuota=50%, MemoryMax=1G): the limits are in the service's own cgroup,
which /proc/self/cgroup names. arm64 /proc/cpuinfo has neither a model
name nor core ids, and no blank lines between processors here.
-- proc/sys/kernel/osrelease --
6.1.0-rpi7-rpi-v8
-- proc/meminfo --
MemTotal:        8000000 kB
-- proc/cpuinfo --
processor	: 0
BogoMIPS	: 108.00
Features	: fp asimd evtstrm crc32 cpuid
CPU implementer	: 0x41
CPU part	: 0xd08
processor	: 1
BogoMIPS	: 108.00
processor	: 2
BogoMIPS	: 108.00
processor	: 3
BogoMIPS	: 108.00
-- proc/self/cgroup --
0::/system.slice/trainmaster.service
-- sys/fs/cgroup/cgroup.controllers --
cpuset cpu io memory pids
-- sys/fs/cgroup/system.slice/trainmaster.service/cpu.max --
50000 100000
-- sys/fs/cgroup/system.slice/trainmaster.service/memory.max --
1073741824
